error[E0277]: `Result<Patches<Counter>, DatabaseError>` is not a reply of an action on the page whose signals are `Counter`
  --> tests/ui/fail/handler_error_not_a_response.rs:12:1
   |
12 | / hypersig::routes! {
13 | |     fn actions(Router<()>);
14 | |     action ADD: Action<Counter> = post "/add" => add;
15 | | }
   | |_^ the trait `IntoActionResponse<Counter>` is not implemented for `Result<Patches<Counter>, DatabaseError>`
   |
   = note: an action's handler returns `Patches<Counter>`, a `SignalPatch<Counter>`, a `ListPatch<Counter>`, a tuple of response parts and one of those, or a `Result` of one of those whose error implements `IntoResponse`
